App Objective
Develop a complete, modern Android application for school management that generates Holistic Progress Cards (HPC) for students. The app should allow the administrator and teachers to manage student records, classes, subjects, academic performance, co-curricular activities, attendance, life skills, and overall student development.
The application must support student-wise, class-wise, and subject-wise progress reports, with printable and downloadable PDF progress cards.
